1866   DBB5             ;****************************************************************************
1867   DBB5             ;* This is the main routine in charge of adding new threads to the
1868   DBB5             ;* virtual machine. The following variables are passed.
1869   DBB5             ;*
1870   DBB5             ;*  A: Pushed into VMregA
1871   DBB5             ;*  B: Pushed into VMregB
1872   DBB5             ;*  X: Thread Initial Program Counter
1873   DBB5             ;*  
1874   DBB5             ;* In addition, the following two variables contain data for the
1875   DBB5             ;* thread.
1876   DBB5             ;*  thread_priority:        Unique Identifier to classify thread
1877   DBB5             ;*  system_temp_word2:  ???
1878   DBB5             ;*
1879   DBB5             ;* See header definition file for specifics on thread class structure
1880   DBB5             ;*
1881   DBB5             ;* Returns: Carry Cleared if New Thread was added
1882   DBB5             ;*          Carry Set if VM was full
1883   DBB5             ;*
