2024   DC60             ;* Solenoid Queue Processing: This is the routine that is called
2025   DC60             ;* to fire a specific solenoid. It will add the solenoid to the 
2026   DC60             ;* queue. Works from top down. Solenoid Number is in A along with
2027   DC60             ;* data on how to handle solenoid. Format of A is ...
2028   DC60             ;*
2029   DC60             ;*      XXXZZZZZ    Where: ZZZZZ is solenoid number 00-10d
2030   DC60             ;*                       XXX is timer/command
2031   DC60             ;*
2032   DC60             ;* NOTE: Hyperball only allows 8 solenoids + Shooter + BallLift
2033   DC60             ;*****************************************************************      
