4519   E9BB             ;* This routine is spawned as a thread when the
4520   E9BB             ;* credits in memory space do not match
4521   E9BB             ;* the number of credits in the CMOS RAM. It 
4522   E9BB             ;* Takes care of bringing them equal in a timely
